# The same run into the wall with the guard on: stop, 20 mm back along the
# path, estop; contact force 0, the wrist clear of the wall, held there.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_wall.txt
mark
guard on
lmove 6 1100 0 1271 0 0 0
run 4
print clear contact guard off
run 1
print clear
@expect arm.off_reason == 2
@expect arm.guard_estop == 1
@expect arm.guard_dx < -0.99
@expect arm.contact_f == 0
@expect arm.contact_max < 600
@expect arm.clear[1] > 10
@expect arm.clear[2] > 10
@reject ^ERROR
